{"id":"38e93590f5dc96ed","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing10-linked-poset.md","title":"ZFC Forcing10 Linked Poset","display":"df-zfc-forcing10-linked-poset — ZFC Forcing10 Linked Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-linked-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing10-linked-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing10-linked-poset — ZFC Forcing10 Linked Poset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-linked-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing10-linked-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing10-linked-poset — ZFC Forcing10 Linked Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> is the partial-order predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10LinkedPoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10LinkedPoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}linked\\text{-}poset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10LinkedPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\,\\forall q\\in P\\,\\exists r\\in P\\;(\n\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}linked\\text{-}poset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10LinkedPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\,\\forall q\\in P\\,\\exists r\\in P\\;(\n\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Pairwise compatibility is witnessed through the declared order relation, not an unbound infix notation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)$ is the partial-order predicate (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10LinkedPoset}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}linked\\text{-}poset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10LinkedPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\,\\forall q\\in P\\,\\exists r\\in P\\;(\n\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)","display":true}],"bytes":932,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2005","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing10-linked-poset.md|58-df-zfc-forcing10-linked-poset]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018"]}